# Record: vhs .agents/showcase/demo/demo.tape
# Edit the steps below and re-run vhs after the tool changes.

Output demo.gif
Require python3

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 21
Set Width 1040
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 48ms

Type "sh run.sh"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 0s

Sleep 8s

Sleep 0s
